{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10297917","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10297917","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1029791701:1":{"text":"我接到了报告，似乎有人偷偷搭着车——","source_cn":"我接到了报告，似乎有人偷偷搭着车——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE680178C11230C9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029791702:1":{"text":"没错，不是似乎，也不是有人，正是我——勇敢的曼卡拉！","source_cn":"没错，不是似乎，也不是有人，正是我——勇敢的曼卡拉！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF35C4062B4E5EC0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029791703:1":{"text":"货厢里比想象得还舒服呢，布鲁特斯大人！","source_cn":"货厢里比想象得还舒服呢，布鲁特斯大人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52427D88786EC7CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029791704:1":{"text":"虽说其他地方比起我们沙漠里面有些潮湿，但对皮肤更好！","source_cn":"虽说其他地方比起我们沙漠里面有些潮湿，但对皮肤更好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF49647F67F8016F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029791705:1":{"text":"我还什么都没说，你就自己全交代了……","source_cn":"我还什么都没说，你就自己全交代了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7B52F673321FB13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1029791706:1":{"text":"算了，本来想批评下你自作主张，但好像也没造成什么大影响，就这样吧。","source_cn":"算了，本来想批评下你自作主张，但好像也没造成什么大影响...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB008DF6659002C6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029791707:1":{"text":"那当然，判断危险程度可是擂台主持的必备技能！","source_cn":"那当然，判断危险程度可是擂台主持的必备技能！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x163505CE051DCA19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1029791708:1":{"text":"倒是布鲁特斯大人，不打算趁机去外头玩玩吗？","source_cn":"倒是布鲁特斯大人，不打算趁机去外头玩玩吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4365102D9650E6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1029791709:1":{"text":"……嗯，上次离开沙漠，也确实是很久之前了啊。","source_cn":"……嗯，上次离开沙漠，也确实是很久之前了啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE5D4B86F980E4709","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:布鲁特斯":{"text":"布鲁特斯","source":"布鲁特斯","status":"source"},"speaker:曼卡拉":{"text":"曼卡拉","source":"曼卡拉","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":10,"localized_text_count":9,"speaker_count":2}}